00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:54,930
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

1
00:00:55,541 --> 00:00:56,541
This is strange…

2
00:00:59,875 --> 00:01:01,375
I’ve got a bad feeling…

3
00:01:02,625 --> 00:01:04,541
Same, Rudi… It’s unusual.

4
00:01:04,625 --> 00:01:06,500
Last time, it felt the same.

5
00:01:06,583 --> 00:01:08,291
Right before that accident…

6
00:01:09,791 --> 00:01:11,166
Do you think… any others?

7
00:01:12,583 --> 00:01:13,666
I think so!

8
00:01:14,375 --> 00:01:18,041
After that, we never saw the bodies
who died in the accidents.

9
00:01:22,333 --> 00:01:23,500
It's complicated Bayu…

10
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:26,458
But…

11
00:01:27,375 --> 00:01:29,583
This time it felt different.

12
00:01:43,333 --> 00:01:45,333
By the way, Rudi…

13
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,500
Where is Heru?

14
00:01:47,583 --> 00:01:49,541
I haven't seen him today?

15
00:01:50,875 --> 00:01:51,791
No idea!

16
00:02:04,333 --> 00:02:05,208
Bayu!

17
00:02:06,958 --> 00:02:07,875
What?

18
00:02:30,833 --> 00:02:32,416
Wait, let me check.

19
00:02:45,375 --> 00:02:46,416
What's wrong here?

20
00:03:13,166 --> 00:03:15,041
Oji? Oji!

21
00:03:15,625 --> 00:03:16,916
-Bayu, help me!
-Oji…

22
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:19,750
Bayu!

23
00:03:20,875 --> 00:03:22,291
Oji!

24
00:03:27,958 --> 00:03:29,875
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Take the bodyใ</font></font></i>

25
00:03:29,958 --> 00:03:32,500
-I't hot, so hot!
-<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Take the soulใ</font></font></i>

26
00:03:32,583 --> 00:03:34,208
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Take the lifeใ</font></font></i>

27
00:03:38,208 --> 00:03:39,458
Oji!

28
00:04:05,250 --> 00:04:06,166
Mom?

29
00:04:09,958 --> 00:04:11,416
Yes…

30
00:04:14,250 --> 00:04:18,416
Take it first
so your blood pressure won’t go up!

31
00:04:18,500 --> 00:04:20,083
I know.

32
00:04:20,166 --> 00:04:22,125
Then, you'll be better!

33
00:04:22,208 --> 00:04:23,500
I know.

34
00:04:26,583 --> 00:04:27,583
Take it first.

35
00:04:31,875 --> 00:04:33,291
-Yuda.
-Yes?

36
00:04:34,541 --> 00:04:35,666
Your drink.

37
00:04:37,041 --> 00:04:39,541
Since when are you
this concerned about me…

38
00:04:39,625 --> 00:04:40,750
What’s going on?

39
00:04:40,833 --> 00:04:42,791
Why is this one never-ending, huh?

40
00:04:43,833 --> 00:04:46,291
If Dad were here,
maybe things would’ve been faster…

41
00:04:46,375 --> 00:04:48,208
You know right, he is the master!

42
00:04:48,291 --> 00:04:49,333
I know!

43
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:55,041
Talking about Dad…

44
00:04:55,541 --> 00:04:56,583
I kinda miss him!

45
00:04:57,500 --> 00:04:59,416
It's feels like forever
since he has been back.

46
00:05:00,333 --> 00:05:04,291
Yeah, he didn't give any updates lately.

47
00:05:05,375 --> 00:05:06,625
I miss him too!

48
00:05:10,416 --> 00:05:14,541
Well, maybe he’s chasing
the deadlines there.

49
00:05:15,333 --> 00:05:18,166
But if he comes home…

50
00:05:18,250 --> 00:05:20,666
Someone’s gonna have it easy.

51
00:05:20,750 --> 00:05:23,000
That guy! Freedom!

52
00:05:23,083 --> 00:05:24,625
You happy?

53
00:05:24,708 --> 00:05:25,791
Mom, it’s okay!

54
00:05:25,875 --> 00:05:26,916
Just let Dad come home quickly.

55
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,333
-Happy?
-Of course I’m happy!

56
00:05:28,416 --> 00:05:30,083
-You Lazy!
-Hey, I could get a day off too!

57
00:05:30,166 --> 00:05:32,416
-You lazy!
-Hey, that’s slander…

58
00:05:32,500 --> 00:05:33,333
That's a slander, Mom!

59
00:05:33,416 --> 00:05:36,125
-Go with your friend…
-You slander!

60
00:05:36,208 --> 00:05:37,333
Yuda!

61
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,041
It's because you

62
00:05:39,125 --> 00:05:40,166
keep grumbling!

63
00:05:42,208 --> 00:05:43,333
-Yuda?
-What?

64
00:05:43,416 --> 00:05:45,500
That… Heru's car.

65
00:05:45,583 --> 00:05:47,291
-Dad?
-Is he back?

66
00:05:47,375 --> 00:05:49,250
Mr. Heru? Sir?

67
00:05:50,041 --> 00:05:51,125
Mr. Heru!

68
00:05:51,208 --> 00:05:52,875
What brings you here this late, Sir?

69
00:05:52,958 --> 00:05:56,041
Where is he? I really miss him, Sir!

70
00:05:56,125 --> 00:05:58,875
-Where is he? Dad?
-Yuda!

71
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:00,916
Bayu…

72
00:06:01,750 --> 00:06:03,166
He is dead.

73
00:06:10,666 --> 00:06:12,416
-Laras?
-Mom?

74
00:06:12,500 --> 00:06:14,333
-No way!
-Mom…

75
00:06:16,375 --> 00:06:17,375
Laras!

76
00:06:18,333 --> 00:06:19,208
Sir…

77
00:06:20,125 --> 00:06:22,458
Sir, don’t be joking
in front of Laras and Mom.

78
00:06:22,541 --> 00:06:23,916
-I'm not joking!
-Please…

79
00:06:29,500 --> 00:06:33,833
Where did you get that information from?

80
00:06:36,041 --> 00:06:37,500
Work accident.

81
00:06:38,875 --> 00:06:40,958
Then what?

82
00:06:41,041 --> 00:06:43,416
If it's true, what about the body?

83
00:06:43,500 --> 00:06:45,083
Was there a body, Sir?

84
00:06:45,583 --> 00:06:46,916
The body was gone, Yuda…

85
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,750
Swept away by the sea.

86
00:06:48,833 --> 00:06:50,250
And then?

87
00:06:51,833 --> 00:06:54,458
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">What step did you take? Just stay quiet?</font></font></i>

88
00:06:54,541 --> 00:06:56,416
Call the SAR team, call the police!

89
00:06:56,500 --> 00:06:57,541
Find my Dad!

90
00:06:57,625 --> 00:06:59,583
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Find his body if he's gone!</font></font></i>

91
00:06:59,666 --> 00:07:01,291
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Call whoever it is!</font></font></i>

92
00:07:01,375 --> 00:07:03,250
Wherever he is now, find him!

93
00:07:03,333 --> 00:07:05,250
We've tried so hard.

94
00:07:05,333 --> 00:07:08,083
-Try? What "try"?
-How could he have died?

95
00:07:08,166 --> 00:07:09,875
How could he die?

96
00:07:09,958 --> 00:07:13,666
Tell me, Sir!

97
00:07:13,750 --> 00:07:16,583
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">-How could he have died?</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">-We truly apologize!</font></font></i>

98
00:07:16,666 --> 00:07:19,833
S-Sir, please bring him back!

99
00:07:19,916 --> 00:07:21,583
Dad!

100
00:07:22,666 --> 00:07:25,208
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Dad, you should come back!</font></font></i>

101
00:07:25,291 --> 00:07:28,666
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Why don't you find him?</font></font></i>

102
00:07:32,416 --> 00:07:34,250
Bayu!

103
00:07:43,541 --> 00:07:46,750
-Dad!
-Martha!

104
00:07:47,750 --> 00:07:49,750
Mom!

105
00:07:50,708 --> 00:07:52,708
Mom!

106
00:07:52,791 --> 00:07:54,750
Yuda, help!

107
00:07:54,833 --> 00:07:57,541
Yuda, help!

108
00:07:59,333 --> 00:08:02,833
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">In the midst of positive news regarding</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">the Suramadu Bridge mega project,</font></font></i>

109
00:08:02,916 --> 00:08:05,375
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">cases of child abductions have been</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">increasingly reported over the past year.</font></font></i>

110
00:08:05,458 --> 00:08:08,208
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">They have occurred once again</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">near the project site…</font></font></i>

111
00:08:08,291 --> 00:08:13,750
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">A 10-year-old girl has been declared</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">missing after playing in the project area.</font></font></i>

112
00:08:13,833 --> 00:08:15,500
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Local authorities confirm…</font></font></i>

113
00:08:15,583 --> 00:08:20,708
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">That investigations are still ongoing,</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">including a review of previous case data.</font></font></i>

114
00:08:20,791 --> 00:08:24,375
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">However, amid this wave of reports…</font></font></i>

115
00:08:24,458 --> 00:08:27,166
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">The contractors are actively bringing</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">in large numbers of new workers</font></font></i>

116
00:08:27,250 --> 00:08:29,166
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">from outside the city,</font></font></i>

117
00:08:29,250 --> 00:08:32,375
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">In an effort to accelerate</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">the completion of the project.</font></font></i>

118
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,791
You sure you'll take Mom
to the project site?

119
00:08:40,250 --> 00:08:43,916
Why not just stay here
and focus on taking care of her?

120
00:08:49,083 --> 00:08:50,291
I'm sure.

121
00:08:55,416 --> 00:08:56,416
Also…

122
00:08:57,666 --> 00:08:59,500
This is all for our future.

123
00:09:05,083 --> 00:09:07,666
For who? You?

124
00:09:16,166 --> 00:09:18,708
Is she only my responsibility, huh?

125
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:21,958
Five years!

126
00:09:22,041 --> 00:09:24,708
I’ve been killing myself
taking care of her.

127
00:09:24,791 --> 00:09:27,416
I never asked anyone for help… and you?

128
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:31,833
Meanwhile you got to study
and live like a normal person, didn’t you?

129
00:09:32,625 --> 00:09:34,208
I also have dreams, Yuda!

130
00:09:34,708 --> 00:09:35,750
But look…

131
00:09:36,291 --> 00:09:38,250
I buried all my dreams deep down.

132
00:09:38,333 --> 00:09:40,208
I always gave way because you once said…

133
00:09:40,291 --> 00:09:43,458
There would be a time
when it would be my turn, now what?

134
00:09:43,541 --> 00:09:44,875
-Where is it?
-Don't you realize?

135
00:09:45,916 --> 00:09:48,083
That place is dangerous.

136
00:09:49,250 --> 00:09:51,250
I went there…

137
00:09:51,750 --> 00:09:56,541
To prove that he was murdered, sacrificed,
offered up for the Project Sacrifice!

138
00:09:59,708 --> 00:10:02,333
I don’t want anything to happen
to you or Mom…

139
00:10:03,041 --> 00:10:06,500
I’m going to prove whether the rumors
about the project sacrifices are real!

140
00:10:06,583 --> 00:10:10,916
True or false, those rumors won’t change
anything in our family!

141
00:10:14,208 --> 00:10:16,083
Right now, Mom should come first right?

142
00:10:17,458 --> 00:10:18,708
Now look what you have done?

143
00:10:19,208 --> 00:10:23,166
And yet you took a job
from a dangerous place…

144
00:10:23,250 --> 00:10:25,208
Just to uncover the truth about Dad?

145
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,000
So,

146
00:10:31,541 --> 00:10:33,125
what's wrong with that?

147
00:10:33,791 --> 00:10:36,666
So what's wrong with me working there too!

148
00:10:40,708 --> 00:10:43,125
At least for my own future.

149
00:11:16,625 --> 00:11:17,708
Who the hell are they?

150
00:11:20,333 --> 00:11:21,750
Who's coming?

151
00:11:23,208 --> 00:11:26,041
Just come and go like the owner.

152
00:11:27,666 --> 00:11:28,708
New worker?

153
00:11:29,416 --> 00:11:31,500
Be careful.

154
00:11:32,166 --> 00:11:34,208
-I can do this.
-Be careful.

155
00:11:34,750 --> 00:11:36,041
Thank you, Sir.

156
00:11:36,125 --> 00:11:38,375
-Alright.
-Oh My!

157
00:11:38,458 --> 00:11:42,083
You even brought your sick mother here…
This has become a real problem.

158
00:11:45,125 --> 00:11:46,125
Who are you?

159
00:11:46,208 --> 00:11:47,750
-I'm Yuda, Sir.
-Thank you.

160
00:11:48,250 --> 00:11:50,708
This is my mother and my sister, Laras.

161
00:11:51,375 --> 00:11:55,208
Introdu- Introduce me, I'm Yanto.

162
00:11:57,291 --> 00:12:00,750
Greetings! My full name is Yanto.

163
00:12:01,708 --> 00:12:03,583
I'm a security guard in this apartment.

164
00:12:04,541 --> 00:12:06,375
You will be in room 506.

165
00:12:06,458 --> 00:12:07,458
I’ll guide you there…

166
00:12:07,541 --> 00:12:09,458
Mr. Yanto, here is the luggage.

167
00:12:09,958 --> 00:12:11,541
How dare you call me "Mister"!

168
00:12:12,250 --> 00:12:13,625
Take care of your mom!

169
00:12:15,333 --> 00:12:17,458
They brought a lot stuff huh!?

170
00:12:20,291 --> 00:12:22,750
Well, here are the rules
for residents of the apartment.

171
00:12:22,833 --> 00:12:25,416
Please read them carefully
and pay close attention.

172
00:12:25,500 --> 00:12:28,833
First, don't be noisy!

173
00:12:28,916 --> 00:12:32,333
Don't dare to play loud music
like 'a boom boom car'.

174
00:12:32,416 --> 00:12:35,125
Wait, these are too heavy!

175
00:12:35,208 --> 00:12:37,375
Listen to my instructions first.

176
00:12:37,458 --> 00:12:38,291
Done? Okay.

177
00:12:38,875 --> 00:12:42,666
Next, it is prohibited
to bring other people here…

178
00:12:42,750 --> 00:12:45,041
Friends, family…

179
00:12:45,541 --> 00:12:49,333
Except for your mother, she's allowed
to stay to take care of her!

180
00:12:53,333 --> 00:12:54,291
Next,

181
00:12:55,041 --> 00:13:00,708
by 10 p.m. everyone must already
be inside their respective rooms.

182
00:13:00,791 --> 00:13:02,625
No one is allowed to go out.

183
00:13:02,708 --> 00:13:08,583
Whether it’s to the shop for cigarettes,
soap, or even sanitary pads. You can't.

184
00:13:09,166 --> 00:13:15,166
All these rules are made
for everyone’s comfort and safety.

185
00:13:15,750 --> 00:13:20,708
Please understand,
that this is a project site, after all.

186
00:13:21,666 --> 00:13:23,708
But the apartment
really is empty, isn’t it?

187
00:13:23,791 --> 00:13:24,875
There are no people here!

188
00:13:25,916 --> 00:13:28,041
It's not empty, Yuda.

189
00:13:28,125 --> 00:13:30,500
Not many have come back yet.

190
00:13:30,583 --> 00:13:32,000
It’s shift change time.

191
00:13:32,083 --> 00:13:35,750
Anyway, all these rules for comf--

192
00:13:36,750 --> 00:13:38,791
Mom!

193
00:13:38,875 --> 00:13:39,916
What happened?

194
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,666
Oh My, how could this happen?

195
00:13:41,750 --> 00:13:44,458
-Mom!
-Mom?

196
00:13:44,541 --> 00:13:46,166
Mom, what's wrong?

197
00:13:46,250 --> 00:13:48,250
Mom, what's wrong? Mom!

198
00:13:48,333 --> 00:13:50,916
-What's wrong with her?
-Mom!

199
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,500
What's wrong with her?

200
00:13:52,583 --> 00:13:55,333
Mom!

201
00:14:00,833 --> 00:14:03,708
-Mom, Yuda here!
-Please forgive me God!

202
00:14:03,791 --> 00:14:06,291
-Mom, Laras and Yuda are here with you.
-Ask forgiveness.

203
00:14:06,375 --> 00:14:08,625
Laras and Yuda are here with you.

204
00:14:08,708 --> 00:14:10,833
-You okay, Mom?
-Yes.

205
00:14:12,916 --> 00:14:14,083
That's ridiculous!

206
00:14:14,166 --> 00:14:15,041
Yuda.

207
00:14:15,666 --> 00:14:17,750
I'm here, Mom!

208
00:14:17,833 --> 00:14:18,916
What's wrong?

209
00:14:19,583 --> 00:14:21,708
Alright, let's get
to the room immediately!

210
00:14:21,791 --> 00:14:24,541
G-Get some ice-…h-hot water, I mean.

211
00:14:24,625 --> 00:14:26,666
So your mother could relax!

212
00:14:27,166 --> 00:14:29,291
I understand, it’s a new place.

213
00:14:29,375 --> 00:14:30,583
So it's normal!

214
00:14:31,083 --> 00:14:32,541
She’s probably just a bit shocked!

215
00:14:37,291 --> 00:14:39,791
It's just the beginning…

216
00:14:39,875 --> 00:14:41,750
Can't it just wait a moment…please!

217
00:14:41,833 --> 00:14:43,875
What was it called?
But it's on each floor…

218
00:14:44,416 --> 00:14:46,250
So we guarantee it would be safe.

219
00:14:47,250 --> 00:14:49,958
Yuda, Yuda… Wait Yuda!

220
00:14:50,041 --> 00:14:52,250
This is your mother’s wheelchair.

221
00:14:52,333 --> 00:14:53,541
So, she won’t get tired.

222
00:14:55,416 --> 00:14:57,208
Oh My, it's so heavy!

223
00:14:57,291 --> 00:14:59,500
Here, here Ma'am!

224
00:14:59,583 --> 00:15:02,250
Just step back slowly, Ma'am!

225
00:15:02,333 --> 00:15:03,166
Wait…

226
00:15:06,166 --> 00:15:08,041
Be careful!

227
00:15:08,125 --> 00:15:10,208
Yuda, you take care of her.

228
00:15:10,750 --> 00:15:12,250
I'll carry your things.

229
00:15:13,166 --> 00:15:14,041
Yanto!

230
00:15:14,791 --> 00:15:16,833
Is this building
really this sparsely occupied?

231
00:15:18,208 --> 00:15:21,583
B-But it’s not like
there are no residents…

232
00:15:21,666 --> 00:15:24,208
Since the old tenant left…

233
00:15:24,291 --> 00:15:26,583
People around here
just won't to stay there.

234
00:15:26,666 --> 00:15:29,000
Maybe because it’s in the corner…

235
00:15:29,500 --> 00:15:31,958
So, no one chooses it anymore.

236
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:37,208
Alright Mom, I'll take care of your feet.

237
00:15:38,208 --> 00:15:41,125
Be careful to carry her.

238
00:15:41,208 --> 00:15:42,041
Relax, Mom.

239
00:15:42,125 --> 00:15:44,833
Alright, here we are at the fifth floor!

240
00:15:46,166 --> 00:15:47,875
Here is the room.

241
00:15:47,958 --> 00:15:50,375
If the windows are dirty,
you clean them yourselves.

242
00:15:51,750 --> 00:15:54,041
Who the hell left
their laundry hanging here?

243
00:15:58,916 --> 00:16:00,416
Please come in.

244
00:16:02,041 --> 00:16:03,000
Please.

245
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:07,166
Where’s the switch for this thing?

246
00:16:07,250 --> 00:16:09,041
Ah, it works.

247
00:16:09,125 --> 00:16:10,208
Come in!

248
00:16:11,041 --> 00:16:12,791
Make yourself at home.

249
00:16:14,208 --> 00:16:16,333
It’s a bit dusty, yeah…

250
