-Thank you, Sir.

258
00:16:43,166 --> 00:16:44,500
My pleasure.

259
00:17:27,375 --> 00:17:28,208
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Yuda!</font></font></i>

260
00:19:20,208 --> 00:19:24,083
