00:24:01,333 --> 00:24:06,458
For this site, right now
we’re facing an issue with cable stray.

318
00:24:06,541 --> 00:24:08,041
But it’s not significant.

319
00:24:08,125 --> 00:24:09,625
Progress is still ongoing.

320
00:24:09,708 --> 00:24:11,208
Soon you will see in this site.

321
00:24:11,291 --> 00:24:14,541
-Let me check it first.
-Alright Sir, thank you.

322
00:24:23,125 --> 00:24:24,125
-Afternoon, Sir.
-Afternoon.

323
00:24:24,208 --> 00:24:26,916
