334
00:25:39,125 --> 00:25:40,083
Here, Sir.

335
00:25:43,583 --> 00:25:44,458
Rudi!

336
00:25:50,458 --> 00:25:52,375
Let’s check the pylon control room!

337
00:25:52,458 --> 00:25:53,375
