345
00:26:28,500 --> 00:26:32,041
I brought you here because
I thought you were smart, Yuda.

346
00:26:32,125 --> 00:26:36,208
Pile installation and other works
did fail at times.

347
00:26:36,708 --> 00:26:40,250
But everything was completed
without spending time on research.

348
00:26:40,333 --> 00:26:43,541
