353
00:27:02,250 --> 00:27:06,041
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Reports of abductions around</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">the project site have occurred again.</font></font></i>

354
00:27:06,125 --> 00:27:10,958
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">A six year old child is reported missing</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">while playing near the coastline.</font></font></i>

355
00:27:11,041 --> 00:27:16,166
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">To this day, police remain confused</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">regarding the motive behind the abduction.</font></font></i>

356
00:27:16,250 --> 00:27:18,833
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">With the increasing number</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">of missing children cases this month…</font></font></i>

357
00:27:18,916 --> 00:27:21,708
Over the years,
children kept disappearing…

358
00:27:21,791 --> 00:27:24,291
Yet none have ever been found.

359
00:27:24,375 --> 00:27:26,291
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Authorities urge the public</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">to remain cautious,</font></font></i>

360
00:27:26,375 --> 00:27:27,666
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">as child abduction cases</font></font></i>

361
00:27:27,750 --> 00:27:30,666
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">are still considered to be occurring</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">frequently over the past year…</font></font></i>

362
00:27:47,500 --> 00:27:49,708
In the name of the Father,
the Son, and the Holy Spirit…

