00:42:54,708 --> 00:42:56,375
Mom!

515
00:42:56,458 --> 00:42:58,125
Quick, Sir!

516
00:42:58,208 --> 00:42:59,291
It's locked!

517
00:42:59,375 --> 00:43:01,291
-Damn, it's locked!
-Let me try!

518
00:43:01,375 --> 00:43:03,541
Push again, Push!

519
00:43:06,583 --> 00:43:08,333
-Push again!
-Yuda!

520
00:43:08,416 --> 00:43:10,541
Here, I have the key!

521
00:43:10,625 --> 00:43:11,583
Alright, open it!

522
00:43:34,375 --> 00:43:35,416
Mom!

523
00:43:35,500 --> 00:43:37,416
Mom!

524
00:43:37,500 --> 00:43:38,625
-Mom!
-Mom.

525
00:43:38,708 --> 00:43:40,500
-Mom, you okay?
-Mom.

526
00:43:40,583 --> 00:43:42,541
-Mom, you okay?
-Mom.

527
00:43:42,625 --> 00:43:44,541
-There are a lot of children!
-Many children--

528
00:43:47,833 --> 00:43:49,375
Those poor children!

529
00:43:49,458 --> 00:43:52,666
-Those poor children!
-Whose children?

530
00:43:52,750 --> 00:43:55,625
-They are innocent!
-Whose children?

531
00:43:55,708 --> 00:43:57,500
-Mom?
-They're not supposed to die.

532
00:43:57,583 --> 00:44:00,958
-Mom!
-Whose children?

533
00:44:01,041 --> 00:44:03,125
Those poor children!

534
00:44:14,833 --> 00:44:16,416
Bayu!

535
00:44:18,750 --> 00:44:19,833
Those…

536
00:44:20,333 --> 00:44:22,250
Those children…

537
00:44:22,958 --> 00:44:27,625
Those children… they’re innocent!

538
00:44:32,750 --> 00:44:35,291
This is Intan, my daughter.
She went missing not long ago.

539
00:44:36,291 --> 00:44:40,000
I’m sure she disappeared near the site.

540
00:44:41,708 --> 00:44:43,875
But she's not the only one.

541
00:44:44,375 --> 00:44:46,250
In the past few months…

542
00:44:46,750 --> 00:44:50,958
Suddenly, more children have been missing
none of them have been found.

543
00:44:52,625 --> 00:44:53,708
Missing?

544
00:45:01,750 --> 00:45:03,750
Have you called the police?

545
00:45:08,250 --> 00:45:09,541
It won't work…

546
00:45:11,000 --> 00:45:15,166
Even the cases
all over the news go nowhere.

547
00:45:15,875 --> 00:45:17,708
What chance do I have?

548
00:45:19,041 --> 00:45:21,666
I have nothing!

549
00:45:26,708 --> 00:45:30,625
Has your husband
been looking for Intan too?

550
00:45:33,458 --> 00:45:35,625
He passed away a long time ago.

551
00:45:38,750 --> 00:45:42,916
Right after he warned me
about the project sacrifices.

552
00:45:43,541 --> 00:45:48,416
I’m sure… he became one of them.

553
00:45:51,500 --> 00:45:57,041
I-I won’t let that happen to Intan…

554
00:46:06,833 --> 00:46:09,875
I know your mother knows something.

555
00:46:09,958 --> 00:46:11,000
Excuse me, Wati…

556
00:46:13,375 --> 00:46:17,166
What is your husband’s name?

557
00:46:17,666 --> 00:46:18,708
Parwis.

558
00:46:30,541 --> 00:46:33,625
Your husband’s name is on here…marked

559
00:46:33,708 --> 00:46:36,500
Just like our father’s, Bayu.

560
00:46:36,583 --> 00:46:38,208
NAME - POSITION - HOMETOWN

561
00:46:38,291 --> 00:46:40,083
What do you mean?

562
00:46:40,166 --> 00:46:44,166
Your father died five years ago
just like my husband?

563
00:46:44,250 --> 00:46:45,375
Yes.

564
00:46:47,958 --> 00:46:51,375
He died in the early phase of construction

565
00:46:52,166 --> 00:46:54,916
when they drove
the first foundation piles.

566
00:46:55,000 --> 00:46:58,083
Laras, where did you find this?

567
00:47:01,416 --> 00:47:04,708
In the old records room.

568
00:47:08,666 --> 00:47:10,666
I took it because…

569
00:47:12,125 --> 00:47:14,875
I think It might be
connected to Dad’s death.

570
00:47:20,708 --> 00:47:22,125
I remember…

571
00:47:23,666 --> 00:47:27,666
My husband lost
during the Petik Laut ritual!

572
00:47:28,500 --> 00:47:30,041
On the night of Satu Suro.

573
00:47:30,625 --> 00:47:33,208
I have a feeling,
it’s going to happen again this year.

574
00:47:36,541 --> 00:47:37,750
Impossible!

575
00:47:38,750 --> 00:47:39,625
Yuda!

576
00:47:40,500 --> 00:47:42,375
Satu Suro is in two days.

577
00:47:47,708 --> 00:47:49,166
We have to do something, Laras.

578
00:47:49,250 --> 00:47:52,791
If what she said was true…

579
00:47:53,541 --> 00:47:58,500
We can prove Dad was sacrificed
by the greedy people.

580
00:48:03,625 --> 00:48:04,625
There.

581
00:48:06,125 --> 00:48:07,333
Look up! Here…

582
00:48:08,000 --> 00:48:11,000
The cable tension readings
are slightly below normal.

583
00:48:11,833 --> 00:48:13,791
Why do we keep making mistakes?

584
00:48:13,875 --> 00:48:16,333
-But everything matches the data…
-Yeah.

585
00:48:16,416 --> 00:48:18,416
-Just add it.
-Add!

586
00:48:20,458 --> 00:48:21,791
Excuse me, Sir.

587
00:48:22,458 --> 00:48:25,291
By calculation,
the tension should already be a match.

588
00:48:25,791 --> 00:48:29,166
If we add it,
the cables could over-tighten in the cold.

589
00:48:29,750 --> 00:48:32,500
You think so? Then what do you suggest?

590
00:48:33,958 --> 00:48:36,291
Yeah, it's up to you, Sir!

591
00:48:36,958 --> 00:48:39,625
If you don’t want to follow… That's okay.

592
00:48:39,708 --> 00:48:43,791
I’d be very interested to see
how you handle this.

593
00:48:48,833 --> 00:48:50,083
Hey!

594
00:48:57,625 --> 00:48:58,750
Damn!

595
00:48:58,833 --> 00:49:00,041
Hey, what should we do?

596
00:49:00,125 --> 00:49:02,541
Everyone back! Call the ambulance!

597
00:49:02,625 --> 00:49:03,708
Please help!

598
00:49:05,250 --> 00:49:06,291
Sir.

599
00:49:06,375 --> 00:49:07,583
Everyone, move back!

600
00:49:07,666 --> 00:49:10,041
Be careful! Look up!

601
00:49:15,041 --> 00:49:15,916
Hello, Sir?

602
00:49:16,416 --> 00:49:18,541
How are the preparations
for the Petik Laut ritual, Sir?

603
00:49:19,791 --> 00:49:21,375
Alright, thank you, Sir.

604
00:49:26,708 --> 00:49:28,083
The worker…

605
00:49:29,166 --> 00:49:31,583
Yesterday… How's he now?

606
00:49:32,250 --> 00:49:34,750
Man…he is wrecked!

607
00:49:34,833 --> 00:49:37,500
How about his family?

608
00:49:37,583 --> 00:49:41,333
You know,
when someone die in this project…

609
00:49:42,333 --> 00:49:44,291
The news would soon disappear!

610
00:49:45,291 --> 00:49:46,791
Here, the dead get nothing.

611
00:49:47,583 --> 00:49:51,625
They never return their bodies
to the family.

612
00:49:54,166 --> 00:49:56,666
I don't get it, it's always like this.

613
00:49:58,791 --> 00:50:00,416
It just a rumour.

614
00:50:00,500 --> 00:50:01,750
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Attention!</font></font></i>

615
00:50:01,833 --> 00:50:05,583
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Due to the Petik Laut ritual</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">taking place tonight.</font></font></i>

616
00:50:05,666 --> 00:50:08,333
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Work will end early today.</font></font></i>

617
00:50:08,416 --> 00:50:12,875
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">All non-essential personnel</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">are to leave the site immediately.</font></font></i>

618
00:50:13,458 --> 00:50:18,541
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">May this ritual ensure</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">the smooth progress of our work.</font></font></i>

619
00:50:35,541 --> 00:50:36,541
The ritual is ready.

620
00:50:45,375 --> 00:50:49,583
It's all just a cover
to hide the real ritual.

621
00:50:53,125 --> 00:50:55,166
What about my daughter?

622
00:51:37,708 --> 00:51:38,750
Take them!

623
00:51:44,708 --> 00:51:45,583
Take it!

624
00:51:49,833 --> 00:51:50,833
Let's go!

625
00:52:23,083 --> 00:52:25,041
Mom, you were
talking in your sleep last night.

626
00:52:28,458 --> 00:52:30,416
You miss Dad again, don’t you?

627
00:52:38,000 --> 00:52:41,666
I miss him too, Mom.

628
00:52:44,583 --> 00:52:47,041
But, Dad’s gone.

629
00:52:48,083 --> 00:52:50,166
You have to stay strong, okay?

630
00:52:56,291 --> 00:53:00,416
Now, you’re all I have, Mom.

631
00:53:02,750 --> 00:53:05,250
I can’t lose you too.

632
00:53:10,583 --> 00:53:11,916
-Mom?
-Does it hurt?

633
00:53:12,000 --> 00:53:14,000
Mom, I'm home!

634
00:53:16,750 --> 00:53:17,833
Yuda is home.

635
00:53:25,500 --> 00:53:26,416
Wait…

636
00:53:27,500 --> 00:53:29,250
Mom, what are you doing here?

637
00:53:29,333 --> 00:53:30,458
Where is Laras?

638
00:53:32,333 --> 00:53:33,375
Why?

639
00:53:34,041 --> 00:53:35,916
You want to eat?

640
00:53:37,291 --> 00:53:43,000
Alright, you can ask me. I'll help you!

641
00:53:43,083 --> 00:53:46,750
I promise, I'll accompany you, Mom!

642
00:53:58,708 --> 00:54:00,958
I'll give you everything you want!

643
00:54:03,166 --> 00:54:05,416
Laras, what's wrong?

644
00:54:05,500 --> 00:54:07,416
Yuda, Yuda…Look!

645
00:54:08,583 --> 00:54:10,750
I-I saw…

646
00:54:10,833 --> 00:54:12,541
-What was it?
-I-I…

647
00:54:13,291 --> 00:54:14,791
Alright, calm down!

648
00:54:15,875 --> 00:54:17,000
It's fine, nothing happened.

649
00:54:18,375 --> 00:54:21,333
It's okay, let's get out!

650
00:54:22,541 --> 00:54:23,458
Let's go!

651
00:54:26,208 --> 00:54:27,083
Mom!

652
00:54:30,458 --> 00:54:32,250
Yuda… I-I saw--

653
00:54:32,333 --> 00:54:34,708
-I saw--
-Nothing happened, Laras.

654
00:54:35,708 --> 00:54:37,583
It's nothing, okay?

655
00:54:39,416 --> 00:54:41,583
There’s something more important.

656
00:54:41,666 --> 00:54:47,291
I saw children…
being taken into the site just now.

657
00:54:47,875 --> 00:54:50,958
-Children?
-Yes, I almost get caught.

658
00:54:52,291 --> 00:54:54,083
I’m going to prove it.

659
00:54:54,166 --> 00:54:55,791
Not the site…

660
00:54:57,041 --> 00:54:58,541
But administrative office.

661
00:55:00,541 --> 00:55:02,791
There’s something off in the basement.

662
00:55:03,291 --> 00:55:05,541
I keep hearing children.

663
00:55:07,041 --> 00:55:09,458
And Wati, I think she knows something.

664
00:55:12,875 --> 00:55:15,125
-Take me there, Laras!
-I can't!

665
00:55:15,208 --> 00:55:18,083
-Come on!
-I-I can't…Yuda, I can't!

666
00:55:18,166 --> 00:55:19,666
I have to stay with Mom.

667
00:55:21,625 --> 00:55:23,833
Laras…

668
00:55:25,583 --> 00:55:27,958
What if it’s all true?

669
00:55:29,416 --> 00:55:33,833
We know what it feels to lose someone.

670
00:55:37,208 --> 00:55:40,583
It's okay…You can go!

671
00:55:46,458 --> 00:55:47,958
I'm okay.

672
00:55:50,708 --> 00:55:52,583
Laras, call Wati now!

673
00:56:04,958 --> 00:56:06,791
Laras, is it here?

674
00:56:11,000 --> 00:56:14,166
NO ENTRY

675
00:56:18,375 --> 00:56:20,125
They’re all inside.

676
00:56:48,875 --> 00:56:50,041
Wati!

677
00:57:00,041 --> 00:57:02,791
Don't be noisy, let's go!

678
00:57:26,541 --> 00:57:31,166
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Take the body.</font></font></i>

679
00:57:31,250 --> 00:57:36,500
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Take the soul, take the life.</font></font></i>

680
00:57:36,583 --> 00:57:37,833
Wah!

681
00:57:59,333 --> 00:58:05,666
This gecko is not a sign
of misfortune…but fortune!

682
00:58:11,166 --> 00:58:12,000
Eat!

683
00:58:45,166 --> 00:58:51,541
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Take the body, take the soul,</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">take the life.</font></font></i>

684
00:59:16,666 --> 00:59:18,208
We only need the children’s heads now.

685
00:59:18,291 --> 00:59:19,958
Prepare yourself, now!

686
00:59:21,208 --> 00:59:23,000
-Start your engine!
-Start your engine!

687
00:59:23,083 --> 00:59:24,333
Start your engine!

688
00:59:33,916 --> 00:59:35,791
That's the children!

689
00:59:36,958 --> 00:59:39,250
Please, help!

690
00:59:39,333 --> 00:59:42,916
Please! Help me!

691
00:59:44,166 --> 00:59:45,458
That's the children!

692
00:59:45,541 --> 00:59:46,833
Please, help!

693
00:59:47,416 --> 00:59:48,875
Laras.

694
00:59:48,958 --> 00:59:51,333
-Take the key, quick!
-Intan!

695
00:59:51,958 --> 00:59:52,833
Intan!

696
00:59:55,000 --> 00:59:56,333
Come on.

697
00:59:57,166 --> 00:59:59,541
-Which one?
-Let me find it.

698
00:59:59,625 --> 01:00:00,500
Intan!

699
01:00:03,125 --> 01:00:04,458
Hurry, Yuda!

700
01:00:15,500 --> 01:00:16,625
Hey.

701
01:00:18,166 --> 01:00:20,333
Hey, don't make a noise!

702
01:00:20,416 --> 01:00:21,500
I'll save you!

703
01:00:24,833 --> 01:00:26,041
I'll save you, okay?

704
01:00:38,416 --> 01:00:39,333
Come on.

705
01:00:40,208 --> 01:00:43,458
Yuda! Intan is gone.

706
01:00:44,458 --> 01:00:46,125
Let's find Intan!

707
01:00:46,958 --> 01:00:49,208
Please stay here and I will go outside!

708
01:00:50,708 --> 01:00:53,166
Let's go! Let's go!

709
01:00:55,500 --> 01:00:56,750
Run, Run!

710
01:00:58,833 --> 01:01:00,083
Yuda!

711
01:01:03,666 --> 01:01:05,208
Hurry, Yuda!

712
01:01:08,875 --> 01:01:10,125
How about them?

713
01:01:10,208 --> 01:01:11,958
You guys can hide outside, okay?

714
01:01:23,666 --> 01:01:24,750
Yuda, come on.

715
01:01:26,333 --> 01:01:30,291
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Take the body, take the soul.</font></font></i>

716
01:01:30,375 --> 01:01:31,583
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Take the life.</font></font></i>

717
01:01:33,625 --> 01:01:35,833
Intan!

718
01:01:37,083 --> 01:01:38,166
Don't screwed up!

719
01:01:42,375 --> 01:01:44,333
Grab them all!

720
01:01:48,333 --> 01:01:49,166
Let me go!

721
01:01:53,125 --> 01:01:53,958
Let go!

722
01:02:01,250 --> 01:02:02,958
Get off!

723
01:02:06,041 --> 01:02:09,375
Intan, Intan!

724
01:02:11,125 --> 01:02:13,666
Intan, Intan, wake up!

725
01:02:13,750 --> 01:02:15,416
The children are gone, Sir!

726
01:02:16,375 --> 01:02:19,125
What? Gone?

727
01:02:19,208 --> 01:02:20,541
Yuda.

728
01:02:22,875 --> 01:02:25,333
-Damn you!
-Yuda!

729
01:02:25,416 --> 01:02:27,791
Why did you screw up this ritual?

730
01:02:27,875 --> 01:02:29,958
Do you have any idea what you’ve done?

731
01:02:30,041 --> 01:02:31,125
You bastard!

732
01:02:31,625 --> 01:02:33,583
Those children are innocent--

733
01:02:33,666 --> 01:02:35,250
They deserve to be free!

734
01:02:36,291 --> 01:02:41,791
Child sacrifices are
our best option right now.

735
01:02:43,750 --> 01:02:46,333
You don't understand…

736
01:02:46,416 --> 01:02:50,125
How dangerous the unseen forces
at sea truly are!

737
01:02:50,708 --> 01:02:53,291
Those workers are at risk…

738
01:02:53,875 --> 01:02:57,458
Because of too many accidents.

739
01:02:58,958 --> 01:03:05,958
Now there is no boundary between
the living world and the unseen…

740
01:03:07,458 --> 01:03:09,833
Yuda! Yuda!

741
01:03:10,333 --> 01:03:11,208
Yuda!

742
01:03:12,458 --> 01:03:18,208
You, came this far just
to find your father, right?

743
01:03:18,833 --> 01:03:20,125
Didn't you?

744
01:03:22,458 --> 01:03:26,125
You really think
your father was a good man?

745
01:03:28,750 --> 01:03:31,875
Rudi, bring him to me!

746
01:03:31,958 --> 01:03:33,291
Bring me that kid!

747
01:03:36,083 --> 01:03:36,958
Look carefully!

748
01:03:37,041 --> 01:03:40,250
Look at him carefully!

749
01:03:40,333 --> 01:03:45,250
He’s your stepbrother
from the woman I loved.

750
01:03:45,833 --> 01:03:50,333
He’s your father’s child from an affair!

751
01:03:53,000 --> 01:03:54,458
You'll be sorry!

752
01:03:55,375 --> 01:03:58,083
Sir, there is disturbance on the coast!

753
01:04:04,375 --> 01:04:05,833
What now?

754
01:04:09,500 --> 01:04:11,166
Sir, it’s bad. Really bad!

755
01:04:11,250 --> 01:04:12,333
Now what?

756
01:04:12,416 --> 01:04:14,791
Everything on the ship has gone rotten!

757
01:04:14,875 --> 01:04:16,208
Which one?

758
01:04:17,958 --> 01:04:19,375
All of it, Sir! Rotten!

759
01:04:19,916 --> 01:04:22,500
We’re doomed… we’ve been rejected!

760
01:04:23,291 --> 01:04:25,166
What should we do then?

761
01:04:25,250 --> 01:04:26,250
Sir.

762
01:04:27,166 --> 01:04:28,458
Is there no other way?

763
01:04:28,541 --> 01:04:31,000
They’re not going anywhere now!

764
01:04:31,583 --> 01:04:33,916
No, there’s something more important now…

765
01:04:34,416 --> 01:04:36,458
Let's go! Rudi, you stay here.

766
01:04:36,541 --> 01:04:37,500
Come on.

767
01:04:38,333 --> 01:04:39,916
-Follow me!
-Sure.

768
01:04:51,666 --> 01:04:53,375
Children!

769
01:04:53,458 --> 01:04:54,625
Mom!

770
01:04:55,500 --> 01:04:57,666
I miss you.

771
01:05:53,708 --> 01:05:56,166
Please accept my condolences, Wati!

772
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:01,833
We’re truly sorry!

773
01:06:06,166 --> 01:06:07,125
I'm sorry, Wati!

774
01:06:08,333 --> 01:06:09,833
You should stay strong, Wati!

775
01:07:00,583 --> 01:07:01,791
-Mom!
-Mom!

776
01:07:01,875 --> 01:07:03,541
Mom!

777
01:07:07,500 --> 01:07:08,375
Mom?

778
01:07:11,166 --> 01:07:12,375
Mom!

779
01:07:19,125 --> 01:07:23,000
You… son of a bitch!

780
